*> XGBoost classifier on iris petals: summary, misclassified rows, plots and L2 regularization.
*> CMD: just TARGET=xgboost_iris_ex run-cobol
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. XGBOOST-IRIS-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

01 IRIS-FORMULA PIC X(40) VALUE "Species ~ Petal.Length + Petal.Width".
01 IRIS         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 MODEL        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 HEAVY        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PLOT         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 FRAME        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 NROWS        USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 ROW          USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 MISCLASSIFIED USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
01 PETAL-LENGTH USAGE COMP-2.
01 PETAL-WIDTH  USAGE COMP-2.
01 PERCENT      USAGE COMP-2.
01 MODEL-DEVIANCE USAGE COMP-2.
01 HEAVY-DEVIANCE USAGE COMP-2.
01 MODEL-PERCENT USAGE COMP-2.
01 HEAVY-PERCENT USAGE COMP-2.
01 ACTUAL       PIC X(40).
01 INT-TEXT     PIC Z(9)9.
01 INT-TEXT-2   PIC Z(9)9.
01 SVG-PATH     PIC X(64).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "dm_data_iris" USING DM-DATA-IRIS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-IRIS-RESULT TO IRIS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-SELF DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_nrows" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS DM-STATUS
    CALL "dm_data_frame_ncols" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS DM-STATUS
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-RESULT TO NROWS INT-TEXT
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS-RESULT TO INT-TEXT-2
    DISPLAY "iris: " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-TEXT) " rows x " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-TEXT-2) " cols"
    DISPLAY " "

    MOVE IRIS TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-DATA
    MOVE IRIS-FORMULA TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-FORMULA
    CALL "dm_xg_boost_classifier_new" USING DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-RESULT TO MODEL
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PRINT-SUMMARY-SELF
    CALL "dm_xg_boost_classifier_print_summary" USING DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PRINT-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Confusion matrix (rows = actual, cols = predicted):"
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-CONFUSION-MATRIX-SELF
    CALL "dm_xg_boost_classifier_confusion_matrix"
        USING DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-CONFUSION-MATRIX DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-CONFUSION-MATRIX-RESULT TO FRAME
    PERFORM DISPLAY-FRAME

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Misclassified rows:"
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT-SELF
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT-NEWDATA
    CALL "dm_xg_boost_classifier_predict" USING DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    *> Copy the predicted labels into the VECTOR-STRING-TABLE items.
    MOVE DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT-RESULT TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-SELF
    MOVE 1 TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-START
    CALL "dm_vector_string_to_table" USING DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-SELF TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM VARYING ROW FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL ROW >= NROWS
        PERFORM SHOW-IF-MISCLASSIFIED
    END-PERFORM
    COMPUTE PERCENT = 100.0 * MISCLASSIFIED / NROWS
    MOVE MISCLASSIFIED TO INT-TEXT
    MOVE NROWS TO INT-TEXT-2
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(INT-TEXT) " of " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-TEXT-2)
        " misclassified (" PERCENT "%)"

    MOVE MODEL TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-TRAINING-DEVIANCE-SELF
    CALL "dm_xg_boost_classifier_plot_training_deviance"
        USING DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-TRAINING-DEVIANCE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-TRAINING-DEVIANCE-RESULT TO PLOT
    MOVE "xgboost_iris_training_deviance.svg" TO SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-PLOT
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-SELF
    MOVE "xgboost_iris_decision_regions.svg" TO SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-REGIONS
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Saved xgboost_iris_training_deviance.svg and xgboost_iris_decision_regions.svg"

    *> XGBoost's defining lever is regularization: a heavily L2-regularized model (large lambda)
    *> grows the same deep trees but keeps every leaf weight small, for a smoother boundary.
    *> Arguments: data, formula, n_trees, learning_rate, max_depth, lambda.
    MOVE 6 TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE 100 TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-N-TREES
    MOVE 0.3 TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-LEARNING-RATE
    MOVE 6 TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-MAX-DEPTH
    MOVE 50.0 TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-LAMBDA
    CALL "dm_xg_boost_classifier_new" USING DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-RESULT TO HEAVY

    MOVE MODEL TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-DEVIANCE-SELF
        DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY-SELF
    PERFORM FINAL-DEVIANCE
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE TO MODEL-DEVIANCE
    COMPUTE MODEL-PERCENT = DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY-RESULT * 100.0
    MOVE HEAVY TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-DEVIANCE-SELF
        DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY-SELF
    PERFORM FINAL-DEVIANCE
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE TO HEAVY-DEVIANCE
    COMPUTE HEAVY-PERCENT = DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY-RESULT * 100.0
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "lambda=1 (default):   training accuracy=" MODEL-PERCENT "%  deviance=" MODEL-DEVIANCE
    DISPLAY "lambda=50 (heavy L2): training accuracy=" HEAVY-PERCENT "%  deviance=" HEAVY-DEVIANCE
    MOVE HEAVY TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-SELF
    MOVE "xgboost_iris_decision_regions_heavy_lambda.svg" TO SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-REGIONS
    DISPLAY "Saved xgboost_iris_decision_regions_heavy_lambda.svg"
    STOP RUN.

*> Prints iris row ROW when its prediction differs from the actual species.
SHOW-IF-MISCLASSIFIED.
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-SELF
    MOVE "Species" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-ROW-INDEX
    CALL "dm_data_frame_string_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH) TO ACTUAL
    IF DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(ROW + 1) NOT = ACTUAL
        ADD 1 TO MISCLASSIFIED
        MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-SELF
        MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-ROW-INDEX
        MOVE "Petal.Length" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
        CALL "dm_data_frame_numeric_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO PETAL-LENGTH
        MOVE "Petal.Width" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
        CALL "dm_data_frame_numeric_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO PETAL-WIDTH
        MOVE ROW TO INT-TEXT
        DISPLAY "  row " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-TEXT) ": Petal.Length=" PETAL-LENGTH
            " Petal.Width=" PETAL-WIDTH "  actual=" FUNCTION TRIM(ACTUAL)
            "  predicted=" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(ROW + 1))
    END-IF.

*> Reads the training accuracy and the last training deviance (into DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE)
*> of the model in the -SELF fields.
FINAL-DEVIANCE.
    CALL "dm_xg_boost_classifier_training_accuracy"
        USING DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    CALL "dm_xg_boost_classifier_training_deviance"
        USING DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-DEVIANCE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-DEVIANCE-RESULT TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_vector_double_size" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SIZE TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-INDEX
    CALL "dm_vector_double_get" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Saves the Petal.Length x Petal.Width decision regions of the model in
*> DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-SELF to SVG-PATH.
SAVE-REGIONS.
    MOVE "Petal.Length" TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-X-FEATURE
    MOVE "Petal.Width" TO DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-Y-FEATURE
    CALL "dm_xg_boost_classifier_plot_decision_regions"
        USING DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-RESULT TO PLOT
    PERFORM SAVE-PLOT.

*> Saves PLOT to SVG-PATH and closes it.
SAVE-PLOT.
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SELF
    MOVE SVG-PATH TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-PATH
    CALL "dm_plot_save" USING DM-PLOT-SAVE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Displays the DataFrame FRAME and closes it.
DISPLAY-FRAME.
    MOVE FRAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_to_string" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    DISPLAY DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-RESULT-LENGTH)
    MOVE FRAME TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
